		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Deployment view\nWhere r2's programs and headers run. Instances are links to the Level 2 boxes. Chestnut hardware is **planned** for r2_tui (the quant SIMD hook already exists).\n\n**C4 notation:**\n- `[Person]` purple\n- `[Software System]` / `[Container]` cyan\n- `[Component]` green\n- data orange\n- tooling red\n- notes + legends yellow\n- plain = external\n- Arrows read *caller → callee*, labelled *what [how]*","x":-560,"y":-460,"width":420,"height":440,"color":"3"},
